"""Pry Sports Betting Intelligence - generated by the Actor Factory.

PPE runtime: charges 'betting-intel-generated' per processed URL, respects
user spending limits and flushes completed work on abort. Builds one report
per event: odds, arbitrage, +EV, props, live state, sharp signals, weather,
prediction markets and Kelly sizing, selected by ``report_type``.
"""

